    "tip": "The production question is marked in points worth two marks each: about seven stages in order, plus one packaging and one labelling point. Include lactic acid bacteria and what they do, rennet and what it does, curds and whey, chopping and draining, scalding, cheddaring, salting, moulding and pressing, and ripening and grading. Diagram: a flow chart of the stages."
