    "tip": "Proban makes fabric flame retardant, not fireproof: it reduces burning and the fabric self-extinguishes. Don't confuse a finish applied to a fabric with a fibre that is flame resistant in itself. For two effects, give reduces ignition risk and self-extinguishes; allergy and special cleaning are the drawbacks."
