    "tip": "Technical unemployment is caused by machines, not by falling demand, so a student who writes 'recession' as a technical cause loses the point. Name the cause, explain how it removes jobs, then give an Irish example such as automation in manufacturing. Use the heading words the question gives, such as 'changing requirements of industry'."
