    "tip": "Keep the numbers with the right group: 35 hours a week is the holiday limit for 14- and 15-year-olds only, and 8 hours a week is the term-time limit for 15-year-olds only. Young persons of 16 and 17 have 8 hours a day and 40 hours a week."
